      "writtenOn": "2025-01-21T16:30:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, but the vendor API level (aka \"VSR API level\") format changed starting in Android 14 QPR3. So for Android 15, the vendor API level is actually `202404`. I wrote up some more details in b/384021501.",
